From 877df095e6ed3e8ca96b55c04645df447d8f0996 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 19:01:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] commit 8: Add command filtering and audit trigger in
 call()

- Add audit_start_time field to client struct
- Implement auditShouldLog(): checks audit_log_enabled, CMD_WRITE
  flag, and customer-command-list (case-insensitive dict lookup)
- Implement auditLogCommand(): filters errors/empty responses,
  creates entry, computes use_time in microseconds, pushes to queue
- Add auditRebuildCustomerCommandDict() for customer command list
- Hook into call() before cmd->proc() for start time and before
  afterCommand() for audit trigger
- Write commands auto-logged, read commands only if in customer list
- Failed commands (error responses) are excluded
- Add update callback for dynamic customer-command-list changes
- Add Tcl functional tests
---
